ags-cd N/DoubleBaboonNinja
IF EXISTS WHDSaves:DoubleBaboonNinja/datas/scores.dat
  copy WHDSaves:DoubleBaboonNinja/datas/scores.dat datas/scores.dat ALL CLONE QUIET
ENDIF
DoubleBaboon >NIL:
ags-cd N/DoubleBaboonNinja
IF EXISTS datas/scores.dat
  IF NOT EXISTS WHDSaves:DoubleBaboonNinja
    makedir WHDSaves:DoubleBaboonNinja
  ENDIF
  IF NOT EXISTS WHDSaves:DoubleBaboonNinja/datas
    makedir WHDSaves:DoubleBaboonNinja/datas
  ENDIF
  copy datas/scores.dat WHDSaves:DoubleBaboonNinja/datas/scores.dat ALL CLONE QUIET
ENDIF
